---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About · unbeholden.dev">
	<div class="max-w-[620px] text-[19px] leading-[1.8]">
		<h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px)] leading-[1.1] font-medium">About</h1>
		<p class="text-dim mt-6 text-[20px]">
			I'm Jakub. Software you depend on should be software you can inspect, move, and turn off. That
			is a practical position, not a political one.
		</p>

		<h2 class="meta mt-12">The rules</h2>
		<p class="mt-3">
			Everything here runs on hardware I own or a VPS I pay for. No sponsorships. No affiliate
			links. If a build fails I publish the failure.
		</p>

		<h2 class="meta mt-10">The dependency budget</h2>
		<p class="mt-3">
			No third-party analytics: self-hosted, cookieless, no personal data. No comments and no share
			buttons anywhere. Replies come by email.
		</p>

		<h2 class="meta mt-10">Licence</h2>
		<p class="mt-3">Prose is CC BY 4.0. Code snippets are CC0/MIT.</p>

		<h2 class="meta mt-10">Elsewhere</h2>
		<p class="text-dim mt-3">
			<a href="mailto:hello@unbeholden.dev">hello@unbeholden.dev</a><br />
			<a href="https://git.home.unbeholden.dev/unbeholden">git.home.unbeholden.dev/unbeholden</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
